// Accept twin of reject/E-FLOOR-NTH/nth-zero.ron. `Nth` itself is
// bridge-capped (E-BRIDGE-CAP) until engine-one-evaluator, so the Erayo
// family's ordinal spelling can't load yet; the nearest admitted spelling
// of "a spell you cast this turn" is the ordinal-free history gate
// [CR#603.2g,608.2i]. The 1-based floor's true twin returns with the
// ordinal.
Normal(
  name: "Accept First Cast",
  types: [Enchantment],
  abilities: [
    Triggered(
      event: Cast(who: Ref(You)),
      condition: Happened(event: Cast(who: Ref(You)), within: ThisTurn),
      effect: By(EventActor, LoseLife(1)),
    ),
  ],
)
